t deals no damage; the 4.5 s cooldown still applies. Your shield regenerates when you avoid damage.\n\nTHREAT VISOR · Orange optic bracket: charging. Muted: recent fire/hit. Lower readout follows one target near aim. Bearing chevrons merge enemy types: CHARGES counts charging enemies; SOURCES counts all eligible enemies there. Individual types/histories are omitted in groups. Clear optic line of sight required; cues expire. Full memories remain in the archive.\n\nUNDERSTOOD\n↗"},"clientMs":206.38400000000183,"pageErrors":[]}
